body:prose = >`
  &ND v2

  # Appendix — Third-Party Validator Conformance [# appendix-third-party-validator-conformance]

  The operational conformance guidance for third-party validators now lives with
  [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts | [$ aeonite-org/aeonite-cts]].

  This appendix remains in the spec tree only to record the boundary:

  - AEOS and AEON specs define the normative semantic requirements
  - [$ aeonite-cts] owns the public validator conformance guidance and verification-facing contract surface

  Relevant public entry points:

  - [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts | CTS repository]
  - [@ https://github.com/aeonite-org/aeonite-cts/blob/main/CONFORMANCE-COVERAGE.md | Conformance coverage]

  If validator guidance conflicts with the AEOS spec line, the AEOS spec line wins.
`
